# Select a local environment from http-client.private.env.json (never commit it).
# Required private variables: adminUsername, adminPassword, adminToken,
# userUsername, userPassword, userToken. Do not put their values in this file.
# Log in, then manually copy data.token into the corresponding private token variable.
# HTTP private variables do not configure Spring's DB_PASSWORD / TEST_DB_PASSWORD.
# IDs are examples: adjust them for local data before running write requests.
# ADMIN examples still require the applicable database authorities.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@employeeId = 1
@departmentId = 1
@fileId = 1

### ADMIN login
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "{{adminUsername}}",
  "password": "{{adminPassword}}"
}

### Normal user login
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "{{userUsername}}",
  "password": "{{userPassword}}"
}

### Employee list (employee:view required)
GET {{baseUrl}}/employees
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Employee by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/employees/{{employeeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Employee create (employee:add required)
POST {{baseUrl}}/employees
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "示例员工",
  "gender": "男",
  "age": 29,
  "phone": "09012345678",
  "email": "employee@example.com",
  "salary": 350000,
  "departmentId": {{departmentId}},
  "hireDate": "2026-08-11"
}

### Employee complete update (employee:update required)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/employees/{{employeeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "示例员工更新",
  "gender": "男",
  "age": 30,
  "phone": "09012345678",
  "email": "employee@example.com",
  "salary": 380000,
  "departmentId": {{departmentId}},
  "hireDate": "2026-08-11"
}

### Employee partial update
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/employees/{{employeeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"age": 31}

### Employee delete (employee:delete required)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/employees/{{employeeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Employee batch delete (adjust IDs before running)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/employees/batch
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

[{{employeeId}}]

### Employee page
GET {{baseUrl}}/employees/page?page=1&pageSize=2
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Employee search
GET {{baseUrl}}/employees/search?gender=男&departmentId={{departmentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Employee search page
GET {{baseUrl}}/employees/search-page?gender=男&departmentId={{departmentId}}&page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Employee department list
GET {{baseUrl}}/employees/with-department
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Employee department search
GET {{baseUrl}}/employees/search-with-department?departmentName=开发部&gender=男
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Employee detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/employees/{{employeeId}}/detail
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Department list
GET {{baseUrl}}/departments
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Department by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/departments/{{departmentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Department create
POST {{baseUrl}}/departments
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "示例部门", "description": "请求示例"}

### Department update
PUT {{baseUrl}}/departments/{{departmentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "示例部门更新", "description": "更新请求示例"}

### Department delete
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/departments/{{departmentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Normal user queries own permissions
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userUsername}}/permissions
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### Normal user queries another user's permissions: 403 when usernames differ
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/{{adminUsername}}/permissions
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### ADMIN queries another user's permissions
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userUsername}}/permissions
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Normal user department scope (employee:view required)
GET {{baseUrl}}/employees/my-scope
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### ADMIN scope (employee:view still required)
GET {{baseUrl}}/employees/my-scope
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Upload an inline sample file; use its returned ID for file requests
POST {{baseUrl}}/files/upload
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="test.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

hello spring boot
--WebAppBoundary--

### File list: normal user sees own files
GET {{baseUrl}}/files?page=1&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### File list: ADMIN scope with keyword
GET {{baseUrl}}/files?page=1&size=10&keyword=test
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### File detail (use an ID owned by the normal user)
GET {{baseUrl}}/files/{{fileId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### File download
GET {{baseUrl}}/files/{{fileId}}/download
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### File delete
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/files/{{fileId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### Negative: no token, expected 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/employees

### Negative: malformed token, expected 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/employees
Authorization: Bearer invalid-token

### Negative: invalid Employee input, expected 400 with employee:add authority
POST {{baseUrl}}/employees
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "gender": "男",
  "age": 10,
  "phone": "09012345678",
  "email": "invalid-email",
  "salary": 350000,
  "departmentId": {{departmentId}},
  "hireDate": "2026-08-11"
}

### Negative: invalid PATCH age, expected 400 with employee:update authority
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/employees/{{employeeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"age": 80}
